From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: kierandrewett <kieran@drewett.dev>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 18:30:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] xwayland: drop the stale XdndProxy name from the XDND atom list

The atom enum no longer has ATOM_DND_PROXY, but atom_names[] still listed
XdndProxy. Every atom after it was off by one. The XdndTypeList property was
written as XdndProxy, and the action atoms named the wrong actions. An X11
drop target then found no types in a Wayland drag and never sent XdndStatus,
so the drop was cancelled.

---
diff --git a/src/wayland/meta-xwayland-dnd.c b/src/wayland/meta-xwayland-dnd.c
index 3634af3565..6782cc4ae5 100644
--- a/src/wayland/meta-xwayland-dnd.c
+++ b/src/wayland/meta-xwayland-dnd.c
@@ -103,7 +103,6 @@ const gchar *atom_names[] = {
   "XdndLeave",
   "XdndDrop",
   "XdndFinished",
-  "XdndProxy",
   "XdndTypeList",
   "XdndActionMove",
   "XdndActionCopy",
